{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "JOS",
  "chapter": 15,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " then was the lot of the tribe of the children of Judah by their families; ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the border of Edom, the wilderness of Zin southward ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the uttermost part of the south border.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And their south border was from the shore of the salt-sea, from the bay that looketh southward:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it went out to the south side to Maaleh-acrabbim, and passed along to Zin, and ascended on the south side to Kadesh-barnea, and passed along to Hezron, and went up to Adar, and fetched a compass to Karkaa:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From thence",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " it passed towards Azmon, and went out to the river of Egypt; and the limits of that border were at the sea: this shall be your south limit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the east border ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the salt-sea, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the end of Jordan: and ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "their",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " border in the north quarter ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " from the bay of the sea, at the uttermost part of Jordan:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the border went up to Beth-hogla, and passed along by the north of Beth-arabah; and the border went up to the stone of Bohan the son of Reuben:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the border went up towards Debir from the valley of Achor, and so northward looking towards Gilgal, that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before the going up to Adummim, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " on the south side of the river: and the border passed towards the waters of En-shemesh, and the borders of it were at En-rogel:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the border went up by the valley of the son of Hinnom, to the south side of the Jebusite; the same ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Jerusalem: and the border went up to the top of the mountain that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "lieth",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " before the valley of Hinnom westward, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " at the end of the valley of the giants northward:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the border was drawn from the top of the hill to the fountain of the water of Nephtoah, and went out to the cities of mount Ephron; and the border was drawn to Baalah, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Kirjath-jearim:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the border compassed from Baalah westward to mount Seir, and passed along to the side of mount Jearim (which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Chesalon) on the north side, and went down to Beth-shemesh, and passed on to Timnah:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the border went out to the side of Ekron northward: and the border was drawn to Shicron, and passed along to mount Baalah, and went out to Jabneel; and the terminations of the border were at the sea.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the west border ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to the great sea, and its coast: this ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the border of the children of Judah round about, according to their families.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And to Caleb the son of Jephunneh he gave a part among the children of Judah, according to the commandment of the LORD to Joshua, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the city of Arba the father of Anak, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "city is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Hebron.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Caleb drove thence the three sons of Anak, Sheshai, and Ahiman, and Talmai, the children of Anak.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And he went up thence to the inhabitants of Debir: and the name of Debir before ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "was",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Kirjath-sepher.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Caleb said, He that smiteth Kirjath-sepher, and taketh it, to him will I give Achsah my daughter for a wife.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Othniel the son of Kenaz, the brother of Caleb, took it: and he gave him Achsah his daughter for a wife.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, as she came ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "to him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", that she moved him to ask of her father a field. And she lighted off ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "her",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " ass; and Caleb said to her, What wouldst thou?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Who answered, Give me a blessing; for thou hast given me a south land, give me also springs of water. And he gave her the upper springs, and the nether springs.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the inheritance of the tribe of the children of Judah according to their families.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And the uttermost cities of the tribe of the children of Judah towards the border of Edom southward were Kabzeel, and Eder, and Jagur,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Kinah, and Dimonah, and Adadah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Kedesh, and Hazor, and Ithnan,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ziph, and Telem, and Bealoth,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Hazor, Hadattah, and Kerioth, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Hezron, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Hazor,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Aman, and Shema, and Moladah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Hazar-gaddah, and Heshmon, and Beth-palet,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Hazar-shual, and Beer-sheba, and Bizjothjah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Baalah, and Iim, and Azem,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Eltolad, and Chesil, and Hormah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Ziglag, and Madmannah, and Sansannah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Lebaoth, and Shilhim, and Ain, and Rimmon: all the cities ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " twenty and nine, with their villages:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the valley, Eshtaol, and Zoreah, and Ashnah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.34",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.34",
      "verse": 34,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Zanoah, and En-gannim, Tappuah, and Enam,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.35",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.35",
      "verse": 35,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Jarmuth, and Adullam, Socoh, and Azekah,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.36",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.36",
      "verse": 36,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Sharaim, and Adithaim, and Gederah, and Gederothaim; fourteen cities with their villages:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.37",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.37",
      "verse": 37,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Zenan, and Hadashah, and Migdalgad,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.38",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.38",
      "verse": 38,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Dilean, and Mizpeh, and Joktheel,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.39",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.39",
      "verse": 39,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Lachish, and Bozkath, and Eglon,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.40",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.40",
      "verse": 40,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Cabbon, and Lahman, and Kithlish,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.41",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.41",
      "verse": 41,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Gederoth, Beth-dagon, and Naamah, and Makkedah; sixteen cities with their villages:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.42",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.42",
      "verse": 42,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Libnah, and Ether, and Ashan,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.43",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.43",
      "verse": 43,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Jiphtah, and Ashnah, and Nezib,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.44",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.44",
      "verse": 44,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Keilah, and Achzib, and Mareshah; nine cities with their villages:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.45",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.45",
      "verse": 45,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ekron, with her towns and her villages:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.46",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.46",
      "verse": 46,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "From Ekron even to the sea, all that ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "lay",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " near Ashdod, with their villages:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.47",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.47",
      "verse": 47,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Ashdod, with her towns and her villages; Gaza, with her towns and her villages, to the river of Egypt, and the great sea, and its border:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.48",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.48",
      "verse": 48,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And in the mountains, Shamir, and Jattir, and Socoh,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.49",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.49",
      "verse": 49,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Dannah, and Kirjath-sannah, which ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " Debir,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.50",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.50",
      "verse": 50,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Anab, and Eshtemoh, and Anim,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.51",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.51",
      "verse": 51,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Goshen, and Holon, and Giloh: eleven cities with their villages:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.52",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.52",
      "verse": 52,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Arab, and Dumah, and Eshean,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "JOS.15.53",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:JOS.15.53",
      "verse": 53,
      "spans": [
        {
